1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,962
Last lesson you read a Gradle project.

2
00:00:02,962 --> 00:00:05,813
Today it does real work: it tests your code,

3
00:00:05,813 --> 00:00:07,497
and it pulls in libraries.

4
00:00:08,047 --> 00:00:13,167
And real work breaks. A test fails. Two libraries want different versions of a third.

5
00:00:13,717 --> 00:00:18,859
Gradle gives you three commands to find the cause: build, test, and dependencies.

6
00:00:19,409 --> 00:00:22,243
You will watch a real failing test get fixed,

7
00:00:22,243 --> 00:00:25,518
then see exactly which library version Gradle chose,

8
00:00:25,518 --> 00:00:26,022
and why.

9
00:00:26,572 --> 00:00:29,687
Then you do it alone, and a checker judges your result.

10
00:00:30,237 --> 00:00:34,503
One idea first: when something fails, ask Gradle. It will tell you.

11
00:00:36,053 --> 00:00:39,872
Four ideas turn a Gradle build into something you can trust.

12
00:00:40,422 --> 00:00:40,679
One,

13
00:00:40,679 --> 00:00:41,709
the build chain.

14
00:00:41,709 --> 00:00:42,803
Build runs check,

15
00:00:42,803 --> 00:00:43,833
check runs test,

16
00:00:43,833 --> 00:00:45,443
and test runs your tests.

17
00:00:45,443 --> 00:00:47,824
A failing test stops the whole build.

18
00:00:48,374 --> 00:00:48,678
Two,

19
00:00:48,678 --> 00:00:49,743
the test task.

20
00:00:49,743 --> 00:00:50,883
It runs J unit,

21
00:00:50,883 --> 00:00:54,761
and writes two results: an X M L file for machines,

22
00:00:54,761 --> 00:00:57,270
and an H T M L report for people.

23
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:58,231
Three,

24
00:00:58,231 --> 00:00:59,122
dependencies.

25
00:00:59,122 --> 00:01:01,725
Implementation is for code that ships.

26
00:01:01,725 --> 00:01:05,287
Test implementation is for code that only tests use.

27
00:01:05,837 --> 00:01:06,186
Four,

28
00:01:06,186 --> 00:01:06,954
inspection.

29
00:01:06,954 --> 00:01:09,608
The dependencies task prints the tree.

30
00:01:09,608 --> 00:01:12,401
Dependency insight explains one library.

31
00:01:12,401 --> 00:01:13,798
When versions clash,

32
00:01:13,798 --> 00:01:15,544
Gradle picks the highest.

33
00:01:16,094 --> 00:01:19,833
Maven does this with plug ins and the dependency tree goal.

34
00:01:19,833 --> 00:01:21,481
Gradle does it with tasks.

35
00:01:21,481 --> 00:01:22,686
Let us see it live.

36
00:01:24,736 --> 00:01:30,645
Go into the project. Type: CD, slash opt, slash lab ninety-six, slash cartcore.

37
00:01:31,195 --> 00:01:36,849
Find the code. Type: find, src, dash name, quote, star dot java, quote.

38
00:01:37,399 --> 00:01:38,352
Three files.

39
00:01:38,352 --> 00:01:40,735
Cart and Main are the program,

40
00:01:40,735 --> 00:01:41,451
in S R C,

41
00:01:41,451 --> 00:01:41,848
main.

42
00:01:41,848 --> 00:01:43,596
Cart test is the test,

43
00:01:43,596 --> 00:01:44,311
in S R C,

44
00:01:44,311 --> 00:01:44,708
test.

45
00:01:44,708 --> 00:01:46,615
Gradle keeps them apart.

46
00:01:47,165 --> 00:01:48,425
Now the libraries.

47
00:01:48,425 --> 00:01:51,787
Show the dependencies block of the build script.

48
00:01:51,787 --> 00:01:52,557
Type: grep,

49
00:01:52,557 --> 00:01:53,958
dash capital A five,

50
00:01:53,958 --> 00:01:54,378
quote,

51
00:01:54,378 --> 00:01:54,798
caret,

52
00:01:54,798 --> 00:01:55,709
dependencies,

53
00:01:55,709 --> 00:01:56,129
quote,

54
00:01:56,129 --> 00:01:57,319
build dot gradle.

55
00:01:57,869 --> 00:02:01,077
Implementation means: ships with the program.

56
00:02:01,077 --> 00:02:02,004
Commons text,

57
00:02:02,004 --> 00:02:03,644
and commons lang three,

58
00:02:03,644 --> 00:02:05,640
at version three point nine.

59
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,424
Below them,

60
00:02:06,424 --> 00:02:08,420
test implementation: J unit,

61
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:09,775
used only by tests.

62
00:02:09,775 --> 00:02:12,056
Keep commons lang three in mind.

63
00:02:12,606 --> 00:02:13,604
Run the build.

64
00:02:13,604 --> 00:02:15,743
Keep the lines about failures.

65
00:02:15,743 --> 00:02:17,525
Type: dot slash gradle W,

66
00:02:17,525 --> 00:02:17,953
build,

67
00:02:17,953 --> 00:02:18,594
then two,

68
00:02:18,594 --> 00:02:19,521
greater than,

69
00:02:19,521 --> 00:02:20,519
ampersand one,

70
00:02:20,519 --> 00:02:21,161
and grep.

71
00:02:23,211 --> 00:02:24,332
Task test failed.

72
00:02:24,332 --> 00:02:24,992
Cart test,

73
00:02:24,992 --> 00:02:26,378
ten percent discount,

74
00:02:26,378 --> 00:02:26,840
failed.

75
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:27,895
Three tests ran,

76
00:02:27,895 --> 00:02:28,621
one failed,

77
00:02:28,621 --> 00:02:30,337
so the whole build failed.

78
00:02:30,337 --> 00:02:32,448
That is the build chain at work.

79
00:02:32,998 --> 00:02:34,147
What went wrong?

80
00:02:34,147 --> 00:02:35,152
Run the tests,

81
00:02:35,152 --> 00:02:37,450
and keep only the word expected,

82
00:02:37,450 --> 00:02:38,670
and what follows.

83
00:02:38,670 --> 00:02:40,465
Type: dot slash gradle W,

84
00:02:40,465 --> 00:02:40,824
test,

85
00:02:40,824 --> 00:02:41,973
and grep dash O,

86
00:02:41,973 --> 00:02:42,619
expected.

87
00:02:44,669 --> 00:02:46,005
Expected forty-five,

88
00:02:46,005 --> 00:02:47,607
but the code gave forty.

89
00:02:47,607 --> 00:02:48,542
Fifty dollars,

90
00:02:48,542 --> 00:02:49,945
with ten percent off,

91
00:02:49,945 --> 00:02:51,347
should be forty-five.

92
00:02:51,347 --> 00:02:52,883
We got fifty minus ten.

93
00:02:53,433 --> 00:02:55,138
Find the code behind it.

94
00:02:55,138 --> 00:02:56,416
Type: grep dash N,

95
00:02:56,416 --> 00:02:57,766
dash capital A two,

96
00:02:57,766 --> 00:02:58,548
total with,

97
00:02:58,548 --> 00:03:00,750
then the path to cart dot java.

98
00:03:01,300 --> 00:03:02,339
Line twenty-two.

99
00:03:02,339 --> 00:03:03,962
It subtracts the percent,

100
00:03:03,962 --> 00:03:06,299
as if ten percent meant ten dollars.

101
00:03:06,299 --> 00:03:07,988
The bug is in the program,

102
00:03:07,988 --> 00:03:09,026
not in the test.

103
00:03:09,026 --> 00:03:10,260
We fix the program.

104
00:03:10,810 --> 00:03:15,055
Fix it with sed. Subtract the percentage of the total, instead of the number.

105
00:03:20,805 --> 00:03:23,813
Run the tests again. Keep the failed and build lines.

106
00:03:26,963 --> 00:03:28,055
Build successful.

107
00:03:28,055 --> 00:03:28,826
No failures.

108
00:03:28,826 --> 00:03:30,817
The test that was red is green,

109
00:03:30,817 --> 00:03:32,937
and the test file did not change.

110
00:03:33,487 --> 00:03:35,643
Machines read the X M L result.

111
00:03:35,643 --> 00:03:37,035
Pull out the counts.

112
00:03:37,035 --> 00:03:37,800
Type: grep,

113
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,426
dash O H,

114
00:03:38,426 --> 00:03:39,609
then the pattern,

115
00:03:39,609 --> 00:03:41,209
and the results folder.

116
00:03:43,259 --> 00:03:44,091
Tests three,

117
00:03:44,091 --> 00:03:44,991
skipped zero,

118
00:03:44,991 --> 00:03:45,961
failures zero.

119
00:03:45,961 --> 00:03:48,663
A build server reads exactly this file,

120
00:03:48,663 --> 00:03:50,257
to decide pass or fail.

121
00:03:50,807 --> 00:03:53,254
People read the H T M L report.

122
00:03:53,254 --> 00:03:54,517
List its folder.

123
00:03:54,517 --> 00:03:55,306
Type: L S,

124
00:03:55,306 --> 00:03:55,779
build,

125
00:03:55,779 --> 00:03:56,885
slash reports,

126
00:03:56,885 --> 00:03:57,832
slash tests,

127
00:03:57,832 --> 00:03:58,700
slash test.

128
00:04:00,750 --> 00:04:03,040
Index dot H T M L is the report.

129
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:06,832
In your own virtual machine you open it in a browser.

130
00:04:06,832 --> 00:04:08,263
It lists every test,

131
00:04:08,263 --> 00:04:10,051
with its time and result.

132
00:04:10,601 --> 00:04:12,349
Now the dependency tree.

133
00:04:12,349 --> 00:04:14,389
Show the runtime class path,

134
00:04:14,389 --> 00:04:16,355
and keep the commons lines.

135
00:04:16,355 --> 00:04:18,176
Type: dot slash gradle W,

136
00:04:18,176 --> 00:04:19,123
dependencies,

137
00:04:19,123 --> 00:04:20,871
dash dash configuration,

138
00:04:20,871 --> 00:04:22,255
runtime class path,

139
00:04:22,255 --> 00:04:22,911
and grep.

140
00:04:25,261 --> 00:04:27,691
Commons text brings commons lang three,

141
00:04:27,691 --> 00:04:29,373
version three point twelve.

142
00:04:29,373 --> 00:04:31,990
But our script asked for three point nine.

143
00:04:31,990 --> 00:04:34,483
The arrow says it all: three point nine,

144
00:04:34,483 --> 00:04:36,165
becomes three point twelve.

145
00:04:36,165 --> 00:04:37,847
Gradle took the higher one.

146
00:04:38,397 --> 00:04:39,550
Ask Gradle why.

147
00:04:39,550 --> 00:04:41,472
Type: dot slash gradle W,

148
00:04:41,472 --> 00:04:42,933
dependency insight,

149
00:04:42,933 --> 00:04:44,547
dash dash dependency,

150
00:04:44,547 --> 00:04:46,007
commons lang three,

151
00:04:46,007 --> 00:04:47,391
the configuration,

152
00:04:47,391 --> 00:04:48,083
and grep.

153
00:04:50,433 --> 00:04:53,218
Selection reasons: by conflict resolution,

154
00:04:53,218 --> 00:04:56,402
between three point twelve and three point nine.

155
00:04:56,402 --> 00:04:57,197
Not a guess.

156
00:04:57,197 --> 00:04:59,187
Gradle told you which version,

157
00:04:59,187 --> 00:04:59,718
and why.

158
00:04:59,718 --> 00:05:00,779
Look here first,

159
00:05:00,779 --> 00:05:03,233
whenever a library behaves strangely.

160
00:05:04,783 --> 00:05:08,303
Your task. The same journey, on your own project, in the lab.

161
00:05:08,853 --> 00:05:10,130
One: run the tests.

162
00:05:10,130 --> 00:05:10,802
One fails.

163
00:05:10,802 --> 00:05:12,617
Fix the bug in the program,

164
00:05:12,617 --> 00:05:13,692
not in the test,

165
00:05:13,692 --> 00:05:15,104
until all three pass.

166
00:05:15,654 --> 00:05:19,494
Two: find the H T M L test report, and note its path.

167
00:05:20,044 --> 00:05:23,500
Three: save the runtime class path tree in deps dot text.

168
00:05:24,050 --> 00:05:29,170
Four: save the dependency insight for commons lang three in insight dot text.

169
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:34,178
Five: write notes dot text, three lines: version, why, and report.

170
00:05:36,228 --> 00:05:40,431
Here is where to find everything. Pause on this screen if you need to write it down.

171
00:05:40,981 --> 00:05:42,680
The lab lives on git hub,

172
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,835
at it dash waves,

173
00:05:43,835 --> 00:05:45,398
slash dev ops dash A I,

174
00:05:45,398 --> 00:05:46,893
in the folder academy,

175
00:05:46,893 --> 00:05:47,573
slash lab.

176
00:05:48,123 --> 00:05:53,328
Two files: lab ninety-six dot S H, and shortcuts ninety-six dot S H.

177
00:05:53,878 --> 00:05:54,765
Install it,

178
00:05:54,765 --> 00:05:58,394
