179
00:05:58,394 --> 00:06:00,249
dash m seven five five,

180
00:06:00,249 --> 00:06:02,104
lab ninety-six dot S H,

181
00:06:02,104 --> 00:06:03,313
into slash usr,

182
00:06:03,313 --> 00:06:04,281
slash local,

183
00:06:04,281 --> 00:06:05,249
slash S bin.

184
00:06:05,799 --> 00:06:09,993
Load the short name with: source shortcuts ninety-six dot S H.

185
00:06:09,993 --> 00:06:11,752
Then you can type: lab up,

186
00:06:11,752 --> 00:06:12,429
lab check,

187
00:06:12,429 --> 00:06:13,308
and lab down.

188
00:06:13,858 --> 00:06:15,030
You need a J D K,

189
00:06:15,030 --> 00:06:16,546
curl and python three,

190
00:06:16,546 --> 00:06:18,546
