194
00:06:24,541 --> 00:06:28,829
Lab down removes everything. Only run it in your own virtual machine.

195
00:06:30,879 --> 00:06:32,948
Pass or fail. You need all six.

196
00:06:33,498 --> 00:06:35,312
Five pass lines in lab check.

197
00:06:35,862 --> 00:06:39,424
The bug is fixed in the program, and the test file is untouched.

198
00:06:39,974 --> 00:06:42,300
You used the wrapper, not another Gradle.

199
00:06:42,850 --> 00:06:47,074
Deps dot text and insight dot text come from real Gradle runs.

200
00:06:47,624 --> 00:06:50,909
Notes dot text names the real version, in your own words.

201
00:06:51,459 --> 00:06:53,315
Lab down leaves nothing behind.

202
00:06:53,865 --> 00:06:55,166
To pass, all six.

203
00:06:57,216 --> 00:07:00,053
Your turn, in your own Ubuntu virtual machine.

204
00:07:00,603 --> 00:07:02,694
One: lab up, and read the task file.

205
00:07:03,244 --> 00:07:05,505
