00:07:36,584 --> 00:07:37,459
Quick check.

212
00:07:38,009 --> 00:07:40,142
Why does a failing test stop the build?

213
00:07:40,692 --> 00:07:44,127
Which file does a build server read, and which does a person read?

214
00:07:44,677 --> 00:07:48,581
What is the difference between implementation and test implementation?

215
00:07:49,131 --> 00:07:51,371
Two libraries want different versions.

216
